<h1>Takedown and copyright notices</h1><p class="small">Draft, last updated 14 October 2026. Placeholder pending legal review.</p>
<p>If you own a tool, trademark or content we mention and want it corrected or removed, email <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Takedown%20request">hello@swarmnest.ai</a> with:</p>
<ul><li>The URL of the page on swarmnest.ai.</li><li>What you want changed or removed, and why.</li><li>Proof that you own the work or represent the owner.</li><li>A statement, made in good faith, that the use is not authorized, and that your information is accurate.</li><li>Your name and contact details.</li></ul>
<p>We aim to respond within five business days and will remove clearly infringing material promptly. Repeat infringers may be removed from any future seller program.</p>
